==============================================================================
S668 outer extension usability / Friedman finite-tree toy
==============================================================================

Source anchors
  Friedman publications list: recursion theory, homeomorphic embeddings, internal finite tree embeddings, invariant maximality.
  Downloadable manuscripts: Finite Trees and the Necessary Use of Large Cardinals; 2025 Invariant Maximality chapters.
  Local term: outer extension = grow ambient object while preserving internal bonds.

